hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1142","Chapter on expelling the Jews from the Arabian Peninsula, 1182 - Muhammad ibn Yahya narrated to us, he said: Abd al-Razzaq narrated to us, he said: Ibn Jurayj informed us, he said: Abu al-Zubayr informed me that he heard Jabir ibn Abd Allah (may Allah be pleased with them) say: Umar ibn al-Khattab (may Allah be pleased with him) informed me that he heard the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) say: I shall surely expel the Jews and Christians from the Arabian Peninsula until I leave none but a Muslim."
